      "point": "The reliance on a one-dimensional chain-like linkage geometry restricts the exploration of allosteric signaling to negative cooperativity between two sites, as acknowledged in the Discussion. The authors should provide more concrete guidance on how these design principles might translate to higher-dimensional networks where strain propagation and mechanical coupling differ significantly from this linear topology.",
      "topic": "Topological limitations"
    }
